  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></math>",
